    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/1/71067.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 4,
    "turn_text": "You won't find more comprehensive coverage of the issues most important to Ohio's labor trades than in the pages of the labor citizen. The full-color tabloid is delivered to thousands of union construction workers each month, providing reports from local unions' interesting feature stories and news that impacts Ohio's union construction industry. But the only way this valuable monthly publication can be delivered to your mailbox is if your local union decides to join. If your building trades union membership is not receiving the labor citizen, ask why at your next regular meeting or send an email to info at LaborCitizen.com.",
