    "turn_text": "With 650,000 active and retired members and a legacy of more than 116 years of accomplishment, the International Association of Machinists and Aerospace Workers is a force to be reckoned with. We're fighting for economic prosperity through the creation and preservation of good jobs, fair trade and respect for America's working families. The Machinists Union, we helped build this country and we're protecting the people who live and work here. A message from the International Association of Machinists and Aerospace",
